## OpenClaw runtime caveat

This SPEC defines the topology. On Claude Code, the harness executes agents via Claude's Task tool. On OpenClaw, until peer-agent spawning is natively supported, this spec is **advisory**:

- User invokes the agent role manually (or via OpenClaw subagent equivalents like Meta Hyperagents)
- The spawning protocol above describes what SHOULD happen; OpenClaw runtime determines what CAN happen
- This file should be kept current as OpenClaw's runtime capabilities evolve

